# Einsteinium · Es · gate 99

**Einsteinium** (Es) is element **99** of the periodic table — a **actinide**, period 7, group f-block, f-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **[252] (most stable isotope)**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
First found in the fallout of a hydrogen bomb; named for Einstein.

